1
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:16,839
Come... It will all be alright.

2
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:21,399
It will be alright. Come...

3
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:23,919
Kanyumaz!
Find a carriage!

4
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:27,279
We will carry the injured
people to the tribe! Come on!

5
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:32,359
You'll be alright!
You'll be alright!

6
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:34,319
Alaeddin!

7
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,759
Brother... Brother...

8
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,879
You'll be alright!

9
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:46,719
Brother!

10
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,839
What do you think you are doing, huh?

11
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,359
Why did you retreat in the middle of the battle?

12
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:57,639
Why did you leave us alone
in the hands of infidels?!

13
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,079
This is battle!

14
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:01,639
Retreating is as normal as fighting!

15
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:04,599
I retreated to protect
the lives of our valiants!

16
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:07,079
You will answer for...

17
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,559
...all the things you did...

18
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:12,199
..before my father!

19
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,719
Enough!

20
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:15,599
I had enough!

21
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,879
Why do you think you are right every time?!

22
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:20,079
Alaeddin!

23
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,239
You..

24
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,319
...by retreating...

25
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,919
...made the biggest mistake in your life!

26
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:28,279
You fled from that battlefield in fear.

27
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,559
You are...

28
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:38,039
You are a coward, Alaeddin!

29
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,839
I am at least...

30
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,679
...a coward who worries
about the lives of our men!

31
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,919
But you are...

32
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:50,799
...an unaware man who drags his men to death!

33
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,519
You are nothing else!

34
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:12,719
You shouldn't have done this Orhan Bey!

35
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:16,199
You shouldn't have done this!
-Done what, huh?

36
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:18,319
You shouldn't have done this!

37
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:21,079
Who are you? Who are you to hit me?!

38
00:04:21,079 --> 00:04:23,559
How could you leave your brother alone there?

39
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,719
Who are you to hit me?!

40
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:27,279
How could you betray your Alps and martyrs?!

41
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:29,639
Who are you to hit me?! Let me!

42
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,599
2 DAYS AGO

43
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,839
Attention!

44
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,199
Osman Bey!

45
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,279
Peace be upon you.

46
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,919
Peace be upon you too.

47
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,919
Thanks to..

48
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:03,319
...Allah Who let us gather...

49
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,119
