56
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:35,399
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

57
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:44,679
With my Allah's permission and
blessings, we made our state free.

58
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:48,759
Now our first duty is to...

59
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:55,399
..help the people oppressed
by the Mongol tyranny.

60
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,839
It is my decision, Alaeddin Bey.

61
00:05:58,840 --> 00:05:59,879
My Bey.

62
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:06,399
Whoever suffered under this oppression...

63
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,559
