66
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:20,279
We will restore our army to
its former strength and might.

67
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:22,159
This duty is yours.

68
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,959
Sure, my Bey.

69
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:31,039
In our eternal duty, we will surely
continue to shed blood and sweat...

70
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:36,079
...without hesitation on the path of...

71
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,559
...martyrdom and war.

72
