78
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:32,999
...the infidels make their moves as well.

79
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,399
Right Orhan?

80
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,879
True, my Bey.

81
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,279
The intelligence we received is that...

82
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:41,510
...an infidel commander
named Gladius, along with

83
00:07:41,522 --> 00:07:44,439
