Bursa to support them.

84
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:54,519
Even if they gather everyone before Bursa...

85
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:59,639
...no one can make us give up on this path.

86
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:05,279
The Alps have been watching
the outpost for some time.

87
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:12,159
Soon, we will descend upon those infidels...

88
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,879
